msgctxt "244"
msgid "It's you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "(Here we go...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "(Wait a minute. I don't have 30,000,000 yet.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Wait a little longer. I'll figure out some way to get that 30,000,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Thank you. I'll be waiting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "I'm sorry this took so long. Please take this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>30,000,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Oh! Oh, dear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Is this really happening!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Oh, thank you! Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "I told you to trust me, didn't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "You did it, Uncle Kaz! I'm so proud of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Uncle Kaz... Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Don't mention it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "You always do so much for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "I'm just really glad you're here for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "I love you, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "(Haruka seems happy...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Thanks for doing all that stuff for me, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"So, um, me and everyone else at Morning Glory made you\r\n"
"a present to make up for it! I even knitted part of it myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "You got the <Color:8>Morning Glory Scarf<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Oh, you're the man from earlier..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Please, Uncle Kaz. We can't just look the other way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "(This seems really important to Haruka...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "Haruka's right. We can't just stand by and do nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"I'll see what I can do about that 30,000,000 yen of yours. Now stop talking "
"about dying, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "What? But, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Trust me. Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"Okay. If you're willing to try and help someone you just met, the least I "
"can do is trust you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Please! You're my only hope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Okay! Maybe I can get a job, and...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Did you forget the last time you tried that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Oh, yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Leave this to me. There are a million ways to earn money in this town. I'm "
"sure I can figure something out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"(Still, 30 mil is a lot of money. I'll just have to come up with "
"something...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Let's go, Haruka. There's nothing we can do to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Yes, this is my own problem. Please don't worry about it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Oh, well... I guess dying is my only choice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "What's the matter? Are you feeling okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Excuse me! Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "Huh? What was that? I'm sorry. I wasn't listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "Had too much to drink? You look terrible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"Haha. Alcohol? No, I can't afford to drink. In fact, I've hardly eaten "
"anything for the last few days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "What's the matter, mister? You said something about dying..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "Why don't you talk about it? It might make you feel better..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid ""
"Talking about it will just make me feel even more ashamed than I already "
"do, but... You sure you want to hear about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Of course. Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "Up until a year ago, I owned a restaurant right here in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"It was just a small place. I managed to make do with the support of a few "
"regular customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid ""
"But three years ago, the yakuza controlling this area went to war with some "
"yakuza from Osaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid ""
"It practically destroyed this town. There were incidents of violence "
"occurring daily."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "Before long, almost all of my regular customers had left town..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid ""
"I did my best to try to make it through, but I didn't have any choice but "
"to keep borrowing money to stay afloat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid ""
"And that led to the sorry state of affairs I'm in today. I sold nearly "
"everything I own, and I'm still 30,000,000 yen in debt..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "30,000,000...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid ""
"I could file for bankruptcy, but that would only mean that the people who "
"co-signed for my loans would get stuck repaying them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "I'm sick of it all. I just don't know what to do anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "So you're going to kill yourself for the life insurance money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid "...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "Yes... I just don't see any other way out of this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "Wait! We can help you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "Haruka..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"Thank you, young lady. I'm afraid there's nothing you can do, but I "
"appreciate the sentiment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "But now that we've heard your story, we can't just look the other way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "(The war three years ago was what ruined him...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Haruka's right. We can't just stand by and do nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid ""
"I'll see what I can do about that 30,000,000 yen of yours. So stop talking "
"about dying, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "What? But, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "Trust me. Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid ""
"Okay. If you're willing to try and help someone you just met, the least I "
"can do is trust you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "Please! You're my only hope!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "Okay! Maybe I can get a job, and...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "Did you forget the last time you tried that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid "Oh, yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid ""
"Leave this to me. There are a million ways to earn money in this town. I'm "
"sure I can figure something out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid ""
"(Still, 30 mil is a lot of money. I'll just have to come up with "
"something...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid "Let's go, Haruka. There's nothing we can do to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid ""
"He's right. I'm sorry for taking so much of your time. But talking did make "
"me feel a bit better. Thank you very much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "Please take this 30,000,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid "I have to try and help him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1576"
msgid "It's nothing to do with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1588"
msgid "I have to try and help him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1600"
msgid "It's got nothing to do with me."
msgstr ""

